# Pairs with TypeOK in ReplicationCausalDelivery. A leaf clock that jumps by
# the shipping-log length instead of taking an unused HLC stamps a write
# outside the declared Hlcs domain, which is what TypeOK is there to notice.
MODULE: TypeOkCausalHlcRunaway
TARGET: TypeOK
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: stamps a write with an HLC beyond the declared domain, so TypeOK fires
PERTURBS: Author

--- FIND
    /\ LET w == [o |-> o, h |-> h, d |-> d]
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: the stamped HLC runs ahead of the chosen one.
    /\ LET w == [o |-> o, h |-> h + Len(log[o]), d |-> d]
--- END
